        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>孤独的非理性信念 — 英汉对照阅读笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 6px 4px 10px 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .main-col {\n    flex: 0 0 400px;\n    width: 400px;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .vocab-col {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    border-left: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .main-col p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .en {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .zh {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  .vocab-col .entry {\n    margin: 0 0 1px 0;\n  }\n  /* highlight colors */\n  .hl-y { background: #fdf3a7; }\n  .hl-o { background: #fcd9a8; }\n  .hl-g { background: #bfe6bd; }\n  .hl-p { background: #f7b8b8; }\n  .hl-b { background: #cfe0f5; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"main-col\">\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">此外，社会、教育和文化<span class=\"hl-g\">促使强化</span>某些关于孤独的<span class=\"hl-p\">非理性</span>信念。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Society has a <span class=\"hl-y\">tendency</span> to think that if someone is 40 years old and living alone, there's something wrong.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">社会有一种<span class=\"hl-y\">倾向</span>，如果一个人40岁了，仍在独自生活，那就有问题了。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">However, it should be realized that the central problem tends to be the belief <span class=\"hl-o\">surrounding</span> it.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">然而，应该认识到，核心问题往往是<span class=\"hl-o\">围绕</span>它的信念。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">In other words, the problem isn't&nbsp; loneliness&nbsp; itself, it's what's said about it, how it's <span class=\"hl-y\">interpreted</span> , and the meaning it's given.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">换句话说，问题不在于孤独本身，而在于人们对它说了什么，如何<span class=\"hl-y\">解释</span>它，以及它被赋予的意义。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Today, we live in crowded places and are <span class=\"hl-o\">incredibly</span> connected to each other, thanks to social media.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">如今，多亏了社交媒体，我们生活在拥挤的地方，彼此之间有着<span class=\"hl-o\">难以置信</span>的联系。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Nevertheless , it may be that this isn't enough for you, and you feel alone because you're single or live <span class=\"hl-y\">completely alone</span>.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">然而，这对你来说可能还不够，你会感到孤独，因为你单身或者<span class=\"hl-y\">完全独居</span>。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">However, as we <span class=\"hl-y\">mentioned</span> earlier, that isn't the problem.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">然而，正如我们之前<span class=\"hl-y\">提到的</span>，这不是问题。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">It's your way of seeing it and the <span class=\"hl-o\">dialogue</span> you're having with yourself about it that's the issue.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">问题在于你看待它的方式和你与自己的<span class=\"hl-o\">对话</span>。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">That's what makes you feel anxious, <span class=\"hl-o\">depressed</span>, and empty inside.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">这就是让你感到焦虑、<span class=\"hl-y\">沮丧</span>和内心空虚的原因。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Obviously, if you tell yourself a hundred times a day or more, that being alone is a terrible thing, that nobody loves you, and you'll <span class=\"hl-y\">end up</span> dying alone, your emotions will be extremely <span class=\"hl-o\">intense</span> and you'll feel <span class=\"hl-p\">dreadful</span> because of these ideas and thoughts that don't even <span class=\"hl-o\">correspond</span> <span class=\"hl-g\">with</span> reality.</p>\n    <p class=\"zh\">显然，如果你每天告诉自己一百次或更多次，孤独是一件可怕</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"vocab-col\">\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">irrational</span>：adj.非理性的，不合理的，荒谬的</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-g\">同义词：unreasonable</span></p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">surround</span>： v.环绕，围绕</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-g\">interpret</span>:v.诠释；说明</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">incredibly</span>:adv.极端地，非常地</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">completely</span>: adv.彻底地；完全地；完整地</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-p\">alone</span>:adv.单独，独自;</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-g\">go it alone</span> 独力；独自干；单干</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">loneliness</span>:n.孤独；寂寞</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-p\">lonely</span>:adj.</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-g\">lonely life / existence</span></p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">end up</span>：最终；结果；</p>\n    <p class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hl-o\">correspond</span>：V.符合；相一致;通信</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
